  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A short report on potential green market in Vietnam as a background information to Team Vietnam member in H&#xe5;nosand workshop as well as an input for developing Center&apos;s Business Plan. It is 20 pages in Vietnamese version written by Vietnam Academy of Science and Technology need to be translated into English and sharing to Team Vietnam.</narrative>
